Package: libclam0-dev
Version: 0.8-1
Section: libs
Priority: optional
Architecture: i386
Depends: libclamcore0-dev (>= 0.8), libclamprocessing0-dev (>= 0.8), libclamaudioio0-dev (>= 0.8), libclamvmqt0-dev (>= 0.8)
Maintainer: CLAM development team <clam@iua.upf.es>
Description: c++ library for audio and music
 C++ framework meant for easing the building of applications
 that feature some sort of audio and music digital signal
 processing. Focus is put on music content processing
 applications (analysis, synthesis and transformation).
 This is a meta-package that installs all default
 framework modules.
